<title>UK: LIFFE coffee ends down, cocoa, sugar in range.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee ends down, cocoa, sugar in range.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Widens losses by the close on profit-taking, origin offers. NY also heads lower. July off $22 at $1,758.</p>
<p>COCOA  - A shade higher but range-bound. Volume modest. July up four stg at 1,010.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Aug higher, rest trends lower but still in tight range. Aug up 70 cents at $313.00 at 1605 GMT.</p>
</text>
